N5008 [dcl.fct.def.default]/5: `goto_symex_statet() = default;` with a
base whose member lacks a default constructor is DELETED, not an error
(g++ silently accepts; clang++ warns -Wdefaulted-function-deleted).
Sibling of cpp11_deleted_implicit_default_ctor_unused; the `= default`
is the load-bearing delta (cvise fleet cv107, 97k -> 13 lines, gate
pinned all three error signatures against the current binary after the
cv98 stale-binary lesson).
